$ 26016 v21 - kingpost (QUAD groups 1, 2, 6, 7) von Mises equivalent stress SV (max over the thickness, N/A +- M/W), WinGRAF.
$ Reads 26016_env_v21.cdb = COPY of 26016_check_v21.cdb (run 13 Nov 2026). No analysis. WinGRAF has no envelope of SV over load cases,
$ so the governing ULS combination of each zone is plotted: LC 122 (Level 2, G+Q+psiW +Y down), LC 110 (roof zone), LC 145 (base).
+PROG WING urs:1
HEAD 26016 v21 kingpost von Mises
DB 1 TITL '26016_env_v21.cdb'
PAGE UNII 5
$ ---- K1 whole kingpost, LC 122, isometric
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 30 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 122
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K2 whole kingpost, LC 122, opposite side
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 30 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X -1 Y -1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 122
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K3 Level 2 connection zone, LC 122
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 20 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -1.2 AXIS NEGZ
BOX -1 -1 7.5 1 1 8.6 CROS
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 122
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K3b Level 2 bottom collar plate from below, LC 122
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 20 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 0.001 Y 0 Z 1 AXIS NEGZ
BOX -1 -1 7.7 1 1 7.9 WIND
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 122
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K4 roof connection zone, LC 110
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 20 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -1.2 AXIS NEGZ
BOX -1 -1 11.5 1 1 12.3 CROS
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 110
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K5 base zone, LC 145
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 20 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
BOX -1 -1 -0.1 1 1 1.0 CROS
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 145
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
$ ---- K6 governing LC 122, deformed shape with von Mises (Level 2 zone)
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 20 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -1.2 AXIS NEGZ
BOX -1 -1 7.0 1 1 9.0 CROS
GRP 1,2,6,7
LC 122
DEFO TYPE YES FAC 50 LC CURR
QUAD TYPE SV STYP ELEM REPR DISO FILL YES
DEFO NO
END

+PROG PLBCONVERTER urs:9
HEAD export the WinGRAF pictures as PNG
IMG FNR 'kp_img/img_%number%.%ext%' OVRT YES FMT PNG
END
